alx-installer-config (0.1.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite Milestone M6.
  * Add ext4-only Calamares partition config and noatime/commit=60 fstab config.
  * Add alx-calamares-launch wrapper gating LUKS encryption on CPU AES-NI support.
  * Add post-install shellprocess enabling first-boot alx-tune.

